'''The Cellar''' is one of the environments in [[Chapter 1]]. It is unlocked after defeating each [[boss]] in the {{s|Basement}}, including defeating the smallest twin first in {{e|Gemini}}'s fight. It is not necessary to defeat {{e|Steven}} to unlock the Cellar. The theme of the Cellar is spiders and poop. Common enemies include Trites, Sacks and Wall Creeps, fitting the floor's theme of spider-themed enemies.

The Cellar's alternate floors are the {{s|Basement}} and the {{s|Burning Basement}}.

{{dlc+|r}} After {{a|A Secret Exit}} is unlocked, a locked door similar to the one leading to a {{r|Treasure Room}} will appear in this floor's {{r|Boss Room}} upon defeating the boss leading to {{S|Downpour}} / {{S|Dross}}. Like a Treasure Room, this door requires a key to be unlocked. Unlike {{r|Angel Room}}s and {{r|Devil Room}}s, this door never disappears.{{dlc-}}

