== Notes ==
* Unlocking the Cellar requires defeating every [[boss]] in the Basement. However, this does not require fighting them in the Basement. It is possible, for instance, to have defeated every single boss except for the {{e|Gurglings}}, encounter them in the {{s|Womb}}, clear the room in which they are encountered, and successfully unlock the Cellar.

== Trivia ==
* Unlike the {{s|Basement}}, the backdrop of the Cellar consists of older, more rotten wood with occasional cobwebs on the wall.
* In the original Binding of Isaac, {{e|Gurdy Jr.}} could appear as a boss.

