== Music ==
* The [[music]] for the cellar is titled ''Periculum''.<ref>[https://ridiculon.bandcamp.com/album/the-binding-of-isaac-rebirth-ost Binding of Isaac: Rebirth OST]</ref>
** Periculum is Latin for "danger" or "risk", signifying how the Cellar is a step-up from the Basement.

